      },
      "text": {
        "arText": "إِذَا جَاءَ نَصْرُ اللَّهِ وَالْفَتْحُ",
        "enText": "When the victory of Allah has come and the conquest,",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Iza jaa-a nas rullahi walfath",
        "bnText": "যখন আসবে আল্লাহর সাহায্য ও বিজয়",
        "bntextLatin": "Yakhana asabe allahara sahayya o bijaya"
      },
