      "sajda": {
        "recommended": false,
        "obligatory": false
      },
      "text": {
        "arText": "وَرَأَيْتَ النَّاسَ يَدْخُلُونَ فِي دِينِ اللَّهِ أَفْوَاجًا",
        "enText": "And you see the people entering into the religion of Allah in multitudes,",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Wa ra-aitan naasa yadkhuloona fee deenil laahi afwajah",
        "bnText": "এবং আপনি মানুষকে দলে দলে আল্লাহর দ্বীনে প্রবেশ করতে দেখবেন",
        "bntextLatin": "ebam apani manusake dale dale allahara dbine prabesa karate dekhabena"
      },
